Date: Wed, 23 Sep 2026 21:47:55 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 06/29] feat(placement): every selection site goes through
 placement_select_gated (LAYOUTGET x2, promotion, prealloc stub and module)

Promotion now honours the effective (possibly shrunk) stripe count instead of looping over phantom entries.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
